-- Features:
-- Save default-named coords
-- Rename coords directly in row
-- TP hotkey per coord
-- UPD/update hotkey per coord
-- TP / UPD / DEL buttons
-- Click hotkey box, press combo to bind it
-- Drag reorder with ☰ handle
-- Resizable translucent UI
-- One selected countdown trigger coord
-- 90-second countdown visible while minimized
-- Safer file + backup loading

